      "widgets_values": [
        "# SeedVR2 2048 Upscale\n\nSeedVR2 is the quality-first restoration path.\n\n- The two left nodes load its VAE and diffusion model.\n- Set the source image in step 2.\n- Step 3 targets **2048 px** and performs learned restoration, not just enlargement.\n- Expect much longer processing than RTX 2×.\n\nFor a fair comparison, inspect the same crop at 100%: skin texture, hair, foliage, fabric, lettering and edge halos."
